<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2689" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊστόω</span></b>  : fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.69
				</span></i>
			 : aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠΐστωσα</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				127
			</span></i>, 
				contr.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾔστ-</span> (v. infr.) :—
				Med.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊστώσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					473
				</span></i>
			:—poet. Verb, not in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, used by <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>, and once in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>, <i>make unseen, make away with, destroy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς ἔμ᾽ ἀϊστώσειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.79
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ . . ἀΐστωσεν ὕλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊστώσας γένος τὸ πᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					234
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρίδ᾽ ᾔστωσας δόρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					515
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρον ἀϊστώσας πυρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					536
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρὶν δὲ πελώρια . . ἀϊστοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					151
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊστώσει μιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.69
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο ἡμέων ἠΐστωσε</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				127
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δ᾽ ἅμ᾽ ἀϊστώθησαν ἀολλέες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.259
				</span></i>
			.</div>
